<section id="perturbations">
		<section>
			<h1>Distractions, motion & time limits</h1>
		</section>	
			
		<section>
		<h2>Flashing</h2>
		<p>Don't create content that can cause epileptic seizures.</p>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Avoid</strong> (strobe-like) flashing imagery that contains <strong>3 or more flashes/second</strong>.</li>
			<li>Important: possible triggers for epilepsy, migraines, light sensitivity, sensory overload,...</li>
		</ul>
		<p class="small"><a href="http://trace.umd.edu/peat">Photosensitive Epilepsy Analysis Tool (PEAT)</a></p>
		</section>
		
		<section>
		<h2>Flashing</h2>
		<h3>Add a warning for users</h3>
		<p>Examples (following links and videos can trigger seizures):</p>
		<ul>
			<li><a href="http://www.fallingfalling.com/">Falling.com (flashes of color)</a></li>
			<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-AVAhOtBev4">Pokémon (side-by-side comparison)</a></li>
			<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zFGtEHJLok0">Citroën DS4 (black/white flashes)</a></li>
		</ul>
		
		<aside class="notes">https://twitter.com/Apple/status/907688647457046528</aside>
		</section>
				<section> 
		<h2>Motion</h2> 
		<p>When animation on a webpage <strong>starts automatically</strong> and plays for more than 5 seconds:</p>
<ul>
			<li>Give control to the user: add a <strong>pause button</strong></li>
			<li>Best practice: don't use autoplay</li>
		</ul>
		<p>Important for people with concentration difficulties and sensory sensitivities.</p>
		</section>
		
		<section> 
		<h2>Motion</h2> 
		<ul>
		<li>Scrolling text</li>
		<li>Slideshow</li>
		<li>Background video</li>
		<li>Animated GIF</li>
		<li>Content flashing</li>
		<li>SVG animation</li>
		<li>Autoplay</li>
		<li>...</li>
		</ul>
		<p>Examples: <a href="https://visit.brussels/en">-</a>/<a href="https://www.blindenzorglichtenliefde.be/">+</a></p>
		</section>

				<section>
		<h2>Don't start audio automatically</h2>
		<p>When an audio fragment starts and plays for <strong>more than 3 seconds:</strong></p>
<ul>
				<li>The user can manually <strong>pause or stop</strong> the sound</li>
				<li>Best practice: dont use autoplay</li>
				<li>Example: <a href="https://www.primevideo.com/detail/0ILGJ4D4ZYPGJCCG2VNGX3LCR3/ref=atv_hm_hom_c_Q0o7DL_awns_2_1">
					Amazon Prime
				</a></li>
			</ul>
		</section>

			<section>
			<h2>Cookiebanners</h2>
			<p>If a cookie notification hides a large part of the content:</p>
<ul>
					<li>Easy to get rid off</li>
					<li>At the top of the source code</li>
					<li>Avoid keyboard traps</li>
				</ul>
		</section>

